id-jolly-slams-byron-donalds-loyalty-to-trump-in-new-ad/"},{"title":"Fact checks hit both sides","date":"2026-10-16","what":"WUFT found Jolly's claim of 60 to 70 percent premium cuts likely false and Donalds' $1,000 hurricane tax figure not correct as stated.","helps":"mixed","kind":"attack","src":"https://www.wuft.org/politics/2026-10-16/fact-checking-claims-from-florida-governor-candidates-david-jolly-and-byron-donalds"},{"title":"Donalds launches Fighter and Never ads","date":"2026-10-06","what":"Donalds aired an ad featuring Trump's praise and another arguing Jolly would raise taxes and insurance costs, backed by a fundraising haul of over $134 million.","helps":"R","kind":"ad","src":"https://www.cbsnews.com/miami/news/byron-donalds-new-ads-florida-governor-race-david-jolly/"},{"title":"Insurance plans collide","date":"2026-10-06","what":"Donalds calls Jolly's state wind fund socialism, while Jolly says the current system already imposes a hurricane tax on Citizens policyholders.","helps":"mixed","kind":"policy","src":"https://www.fox13news.com/news/florida-governor-candidates-clash-over-home-insurance-accuse-each-other-supporting-hurricane-tax"},{"title":"Dueling tours on the Suncoast","date":"2026-10-03","what":"Donalds praised Republican leadership on his Defending the Florida Dream tour while Jolly met with the Sarasota school board about education funding.","helps":"mixed","kind":"rally","src":"https://www.mysuncoast.com/2026/10/03/florida-governors-race-intensifies-donalds-jolly-court-voters-statewide/"},{"title":"FAMU debate canceled","date":"2026-09-24","what":"Florida A&M canceled a planned gubernatorial debate after the campaigns could not agree.","helps":"mixed","kind":"debate","src":"https://www.wctv.tv/2026/09/24/disappointed-famu-cancels-gubernatorial-debate/"},{"title":"Jolly says no to debates","date":"2026-09-21","what":"Jolly's campaign said he would not debate, arguing the Donalds camp tried to control the moderator, location and timing, and e